%description:
After a timeout, NewReno does not enter fast retransmit for duplicate ACKs
that the go-back-N causes (RFC 6582 step 4). The tester drops four
segments of one flight (a27, a28, a30, a33) and the fast retransmission
a41, so the retransmission timer expires. In slow start, the sender sends
each hole again together with segments that the receiver already has. At
t=2.243 s, B acknowledges the last hole (B031) and sends three duplicate
ACKs for those copies (B032 to B034). "recover" still holds the highest
sequence number sent before the timeout, so the sender sends new data
and does not retransmit 39937:40961.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true

*.tcptester.cmdenv-log-level=DEBUG
**.cmdenv-log-level=OFF

*.cli_app.tSend=1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=65536B # 64 1024-byte segments

*.tcptester.script="a27 delete; a28 delete; a30 delete; a33 delete; a41 delete"  # four holes, and the fast retransmission

*.*_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpNewReno"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%contains: stdout
[2.243 B031] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 39937 win 16384
[2.243 B032] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 39937 win 16384
[2.243 B033] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 39937 win 16384
[2.243 B034] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 39937 win 16384
[2.245 A053] A.1000 > B.2000: A 39937:40961(1024) ack 501 win 16384
[2.245 A054] A.1000 > B.2000: A 40961:41985(1024) ack 501 win 16384
[2.245 A055] A.1000 > B.2000: A 41985:43009(1024) ack 501 win 16384
[2.245 A056] A.1000 > B.2000: A 43009:44033(1024) ack 501 win 16384
[2.245 A057] A.1000 > B.2000: A 44033:45057(1024) ack 501 win 16384
[2.247 B035] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 41985 win 16384

%contains: stdout
[2.460] tcpdump finished, A:77 B:47 segments

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
